    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Management</strong> exists in a fantasy world of the contemporary age. Mighty warriors and mystical wizards now adorn streetwear and star in movies. Adventuring is a common pass time, but to do it you must be licensed under a party manager. This is where <i>you\u00a0</i>come in. Select and manage 6 unique party members for each puzzle and use their abilities to guide them on a treacherous adventure into the golden city of Opulence in hopes of striking it rich, quitting their 9-5\u2019s, and following their dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique RPG Themed Puzzling Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 19 trials across 4 areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your party and take on harder challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart the world around you through Ava\u2019s Log</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 6 unique abilities across your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of Opulence and Confluence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay your favorite trials with an expanded party to find new solutions</p></li></ul>",
